# anthropic_environment_archive (Resource)

Archives an Anthropic cloud environment (beta). Archived environments cannot be used to create new sessions.

**Important:** Archiving is a one-way operation — there is no unarchive API. Destroying this Terraform resource does **not** delete or unarchive the environment; it only removes the resource from Terraform state.

